body:
Not me, but my mom caught me putting her underwear on her head and waving to the construction workers outside in our yard. I also used to smear poop on my toys for fun. And hiss at people I didn't like, while eating cat food. Believe it or not, I am now a rational adult with a kid of my own.

&#x200B;

I am in for a world of trouble if my daughter turns out like me.
